  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.48 Long Pond.\n\n(a) Water skiing on all portions of Long Pond in Lempster shall be restricted to the hours of 1:00 p.m. to 3:00 p.m.\n\n(b) No person shall operate a motorboat at a speed exceeding 6 miles per hours on the waters surrounding the 3 islands in the northern end of Long Pond.\n\nSource. #2351, eff 4-25-83; ss by #3010, eff 5-2-85; ss by #4562, eff 1-3-89; ss by #5936, INTERIM, eff 1-3-95, EXPIRES: 5-3-95; ss by #6005, eff 3-24-95, EXPIRED: 3-24-03\n\nNew. #7904, INTERIM, eff 6-24-03, EXPIRED: 12-21-03\n\nNew. #8107, EMERGENCY, eff 6-22-04, EXPIRES: 12-19-04; ss and moved by #8172, eff 9-21-04 (from Saf-C 402.36); ss by #10169, EXEMPT, eff 8-8-12 (formerly Saf-C 402.44) (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5100)",
